WEBVTT

00:01.690 --> 00:03.027
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.051 --> 00:04.386
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.410 --> 00:07.626
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.650 --> 00:13.210
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.210 --> 01:31.170
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.330 --> 01:34.570
=Episode 9=

01:36.945 --> 01:38.570
Jian Jiuhuang asked me to come here.

01:40.930 --> 01:41.930
Old Huang?

01:42.245 --> 01:43.245
Wait!

01:47.220 --> 01:48.220
Do you mean

01:48.945 --> 01:49.907
Old Huang

01:49.931 --> 01:51.795
asked you to take Huangman'er
to Mount Longhu?

01:52.210 --> 01:54.920
Jian Jiuhuang knew
you were in a dilemma.

01:55.049 --> 01:56.146
He left North Liang

01:56.170 --> 01:57.420
and came to Mount Longhu.

01:57.810 --> 01:59.270
You know

01:59.529 --> 02:01.045
your brother is now

02:01.370 --> 02:03.245
wanted by many.

02:06.095 --> 02:08.170
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

02:09.595 --> 02:11.089
What else did you find?

02:11.395 --> 02:13.410
And those who supported Young Master.

02:14.145 --> 02:14.822
Didn't you catch them?

02:14.846 --> 02:16.049
Like Ning Emei,

02:16.270 --> 02:17.730
they were all baits.

02:18.370 --> 02:19.889
The mastermind behind

02:20.120 --> 02:21.120
is well hidden.

02:27.220 --> 02:29.250
Is Fengnian in Wudang?

02:29.645 --> 02:30.645
Yes.

02:30.820 --> 02:32.290
He refuses to leave there.

02:33.320 --> 02:34.545
He'll come around.

02:36.895 --> 02:38.609
The royal is going crazy

02:38.695 --> 02:40.095
waiting for North Liang's mistakes.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.745
But they know,

02:42.290 --> 02:43.845
as long as you are in charge,

02:44.395 --> 02:46.170
North Liang is the Xus'.

02:48.395 --> 02:49.970
We all die.

02:50.370 --> 02:52.290
That's why Young Master matters.

02:53.370 --> 02:55.570
If you hand over North Liang
to Xu Fengnian,

02:56.220 --> 02:58.730
the royal will seek power
by using Young Master,

02:59.020 --> 03:00.450
and North Liang will fall apart.

03:01.445 --> 03:02.970
If you hand over North Liang

03:03.920 --> 03:05.120
to Young Master...

03:07.220 --> 03:09.010
That's exactly what they want.

03:10.770 --> 03:11.970
Huangman'er

03:12.320 --> 03:13.410
is still young.

03:14.720 --> 03:16.170
How can he beat

03:16.545 --> 03:19.450
the wily royals?

03:20.530 --> 03:21.530
Thus,

03:21.820 --> 03:23.870
all the eyes in the capital are
on Young Master.

03:24.329 --> 03:25.395
Speaking boldly,

03:25.730 --> 03:27.145
in this world,

03:27.489 --> 03:29.145
only my Mount Longhu

03:29.489 --> 03:32.010
can keep him safe.

03:35.170 --> 03:37.170
Mount Longhu has no connection

03:37.595 --> 03:38.889
to our Xu family.

03:39.220 --> 03:41.820
Jian Jiuhuang once told me,

03:41.945 --> 03:42.945
Young Master

03:43.770 --> 03:45.345
was born with great power

03:45.595 --> 03:47.020
and excellent talent.

03:47.245 --> 03:48.245
So what?

03:49.845 --> 03:51.450
Do you know

03:51.620 --> 03:54.609
why I haven't yet taken any disciple?

03:55.320 --> 03:57.089
Because the Heart Arts of my sect

03:57.320 --> 03:59.119
has extremely high requirements

03:59.370 --> 04:01.809
on the disciple.

04:02.250 --> 04:04.690
One must be born extraordinary

04:05.010 --> 04:07.049
to assume the mantle.

04:07.445 --> 04:08.730
Jian Jiuhuang chose me,

04:09.170 --> 04:10.170
because I truly meant to

04:10.889 --> 04:12.530
take him as my disciple.

04:12.970 --> 04:14.250
Your Highness.

04:15.145 --> 04:16.410
It's true.

04:17.070 --> 04:19.295
The line of the sect matters more

04:19.695 --> 04:20.929
than their own lives.

04:24.530 --> 04:26.146
So, will you protect Huangman'er?

04:26.170 --> 04:27.170
Since he's my disciple,

04:27.995 --> 04:29.545
that's for sure.

04:29.569 --> 04:31.320
The capital and the royal

04:31.530 --> 04:32.890
all have their eyes on my brother.

04:33.330 --> 04:35.395
Mount Longhu is known as the Top Sect.

04:35.850 --> 04:37.689
Can you really resist
the imperial edict?

04:38.129 --> 04:40.645
That's exactly the deal

04:41.009 --> 04:42.521
Jian Jiuhuang made with us.

04:42.545 --> 04:43.570
What deal?

04:48.545 --> 04:50.249
It concerns the royal,

04:50.695 --> 04:51.890
highly confidential.

04:52.520 --> 04:53.520
I can

04:53.745 --> 04:55.970
tell you only.

05:00.320 --> 05:01.320
I...

05:01.595 --> 05:02.820
I'll wait outside.

05:07.495 --> 05:08.495
You can stay and listen.

05:08.995 --> 05:10.420
Given my identity,

05:10.720 --> 05:12.070
to listen to Liyang's secret,

05:12.145 --> 05:14.009
do you want me to die sooner?

05:27.045 --> 05:28.290
Why are you out?

05:28.870 --> 05:29.870
I don't wanna die.

05:34.470 --> 05:35.826
I'm really confused

05:35.850 --> 05:37.410
about Xu Fengnian and you.

05:37.770 --> 05:38.920
Why?

05:42.995 --> 05:43.995
Young lady.

05:44.870 --> 05:47.330
Of all people in the world,

05:48.970 --> 05:50.609
it's hard to meet the right one.

05:51.795 --> 05:53.820
People are not chained to each other.

05:54.970 --> 05:56.410
Time separates them.

05:58.395 --> 05:59.850
Cherish the present.

06:01.070 --> 06:03.609
Don't be like me,

06:05.095 --> 06:06.809
only regrets left at my age.

06:08.845 --> 06:10.330
There is nothing to cherish.

06:10.595 --> 06:11.595
It has been fated

06:11.929 --> 06:13.330
between us.

06:13.845 --> 06:14.850
What is fated?

06:17.470 --> 06:18.530
Life and death.

06:19.745 --> 06:20.866
We are alone now.

06:20.890 --> 06:21.627
Please go ahead.

06:21.651 --> 06:22.809
Why do you think

06:23.370 --> 06:24.495
Mount Longhu

06:24.995 --> 06:28.210
is the Top Sect?

06:28.920 --> 06:30.200
Did you pledge allegiance early?

06:31.645 --> 06:34.850
Because one person hides here.

06:35.320 --> 06:36.770
He's also surnamed Zhao.

06:38.520 --> 06:41.369
Isn't everyone surnamed Zhao
after Arch-Taoist?

06:42.170 --> 06:43.929
Not Arch-Taoist's surname Zhao,

06:44.720 --> 06:46.809
but the royal surname Zhao.

06:47.445 --> 06:48.249
The royal?

06:48.345 --> 06:49.345
Yes.

06:49.489 --> 06:50.397
As to seniority,

06:50.421 --> 06:53.395
he's the ancestor of Liyang.

06:55.220 --> 06:57.970
A royal hides in Mount Longhu.

06:58.120 --> 07:00.225
Who else deserves the title

07:00.249 --> 07:01.489
of the Top Sect?

07:03.445 --> 07:04.770
Why does he hide in Mount Longhu?

07:05.720 --> 07:07.306
He is fishing.

07:07.330 --> 07:08.330
What?

07:08.845 --> 07:10.306
Don't bother about the details.

07:10.330 --> 07:11.620
You only need to know

07:11.809 --> 07:14.266
he pursues the ultimate martial arts

07:14.290 --> 07:15.520
in the world.

07:15.970 --> 07:18.090
But to achieve it,

07:19.970 --> 07:22.071
Wang Xianzhi in Wudi City

07:22.095 --> 07:24.395
is an unavoidable challenge.

07:26.470 --> 07:28.370
An old man in Mount Longhu

07:28.520 --> 07:30.946
wants to test Wang Xianzhi's strength,

07:30.970 --> 07:32.585
but he doesn't dare.

07:32.609 --> 07:33.796
Knowing that I'd go to challenge him,

07:33.820 --> 07:36.170
he gladly wanted to watch it.

07:36.295 --> 07:37.585
Isn't it a deal?

07:37.609 --> 07:39.689
Did Old Huang put himself in the deal?

07:40.020 --> 07:41.020
Exactly.

07:41.890 --> 07:44.890
Jian Jiuhuang challenges Wang Xianzhi.

07:45.445 --> 07:46.445
That person

07:46.745 --> 07:49.345
tries to test Wang Xianzhi's strength,

07:49.369 --> 07:52.050
provided that Mount Longhu
protects Young Master.

07:52.645 --> 07:54.320
Will the royal let it go at that?

07:55.220 --> 07:57.465
After all, a royal elder proposed it.

07:57.489 --> 07:58.489
Moreover,

07:59.120 --> 08:00.970
he is in Mount Longhu.

08:01.070 --> 08:02.650
The royal is at ease, of course.

08:02.929 --> 08:06.210
Plus, he's my disciple now.

08:06.995 --> 08:10.555
I'll protect Young Master in secret.

08:11.520 --> 08:12.650
In all aspects,

08:12.720 --> 08:15.045
Young Master is perfectly safe.

08:16.129 --> 08:17.129
Your Highness.

08:17.609 --> 08:18.970
Jian Jiuhuang once said,

08:19.345 --> 08:20.520
he came to Mount Longhu

08:20.689 --> 08:22.105
so that you could

08:22.129 --> 08:24.129
figure out a third way.

08:24.890 --> 08:27.306
These days, I've been thinking about

08:27.330 --> 08:30.449
the things in the past three years.

08:31.445 --> 08:34.106
I'm useless,

08:34.130 --> 08:35.130
but

08:36.070 --> 08:38.145
I wanna help you.

08:39.345 --> 08:40.650
Old Huang.

08:42.470 --> 08:44.370
Who won, Wang Xianzhi or he?

08:44.729 --> 08:45.969
The latest information has that

08:46.020 --> 08:47.795
he is already outside Wudi City.

08:48.969 --> 08:49.969
I guess

08:50.410 --> 08:52.670
the result of the battle will come soon.

08:52.809 --> 08:55.969
If any news, I'll get you updated.

09:00.320 --> 09:01.345
I've said everything.

09:01.870 --> 09:03.425
Can I see

09:03.449 --> 09:04.845
Young Master Longxiang now?

09:10.520 --> 09:11.520
Thanks,

09:12.020 --> 09:13.020
but no.

09:13.445 --> 09:14.147
This...

09:14.171 --> 09:16.145
This is the best way out.

09:16.270 --> 09:17.410
Mount Longhu is far away.

09:17.620 --> 09:18.729
Huangman'er will miss home.

09:19.995 --> 09:21.945
Will you take him back to North Liang?

09:22.145 --> 09:23.145
I'm his brother.

09:23.245 --> 09:24.245
I'll protect him.

09:25.545 --> 09:27.209
If he goes back,

09:27.470 --> 09:29.921
North Liang will be in great chaos.

09:29.945 --> 09:30.945
I know.

09:31.045 --> 09:32.045
I'll cope with it.

09:33.295 --> 09:34.295
Brother.

09:34.410 --> 09:35.746
I'll go to Mount Longhu with him.

09:35.770 --> 09:37.196
You know nothing. Don't talk nonsense!

09:37.220 --> 09:38.045
I do!

09:38.195 --> 09:38.849
If I go,

09:38.995 --> 09:39.506
I can help you.

09:39.530 --> 09:40.530
Nonsense.

09:40.670 --> 09:41.890
I don't need your help.

09:42.045 --> 09:42.867
Stay at home.

09:42.891 --> 09:44.130
You have me whatever happens.

09:44.745 --> 09:45.345
Brother.

09:45.620 --> 09:46.620
I'm willing to go.

09:57.120 --> 10:00.561
You are the talented one in the world!

10:00.645 --> 10:02.849
Jian Jiuhuang didn't lie to me!

10:03.595 --> 10:04.890
The line of my school

10:05.295 --> 10:06.820
will be finally carried on!

10:07.770 --> 10:08.770
Taoist Priest.

10:09.645 --> 10:10.689
Can we leave now?

10:10.795 --> 10:12.370
Call me Master!

10:23.270 --> 10:24.929
Why do you take so many men out?

10:26.345 --> 10:27.650
I don't want this, either.

10:28.370 --> 10:29.920
The newest sect rule.

10:30.170 --> 10:33.145
It's a must when Arch-Taoist goes out.

10:34.895 --> 10:36.185
Why did you talk

10:36.209 --> 10:37.490
with the door closed?

10:37.620 --> 10:39.410
If I hadn't put on airs,

10:39.745 --> 10:42.130
they would've reported it to the Chief.

10:42.969 --> 10:45.106
And I have to explain.

10:45.130 --> 10:46.569
It's annoying.

10:46.870 --> 10:48.845
Are there so many rules in your sect?

10:49.195 --> 10:50.275
Don't worry, Your Highness.

10:50.870 --> 10:52.271
My courtyard

10:52.295 --> 10:54.226
is at the foot of Mount Longhu,

10:54.250 --> 10:55.495
far away from the sect.

10:55.890 --> 10:56.929
I have no rules there.

10:57.095 --> 10:59.321
I won't let my disciple down.

10:59.345 --> 11:00.345
Don't beat him.

11:00.620 --> 11:01.620
Don't scold him.

11:01.970 --> 11:02.970
Don't bully him.

11:03.570 --> 11:05.146
I finally got a disciple.

11:05.170 --> 11:06.296
I will never allow him

11:06.320 --> 11:07.449
to be bullied.

11:08.495 --> 11:09.721
Your Highness.

11:09.745 --> 11:11.170
Rest assured.

11:11.490 --> 11:12.490
My place

11:12.895 --> 11:14.785
is picturesque

11:14.809 --> 11:16.290
and pleasing.

11:16.770 --> 11:18.689
I'm sure he will like it.

11:18.890 --> 11:20.929
There are rare creatures
in the mountain

11:21.250 --> 11:22.569
for him to catch,

11:22.650 --> 11:24.986
and peach trees and hawthorns.

11:25.010 --> 11:26.645
He can pick the fruits.

11:27.245 --> 11:28.266
Hawthorns?

11:28.290 --> 11:29.466
Yes, hawthorns.

11:29.490 --> 11:30.490
Are there many?

11:30.595 --> 11:32.570
Yes, many hawthorns.

11:32.820 --> 11:33.587
What?

11:33.611 --> 11:35.445
Do you like hawthorns?

11:35.595 --> 11:36.595
My brother does.

11:37.295 --> 11:38.295
Brother.

11:38.395 --> 11:39.570
When hawthorns are ripe,

11:39.995 --> 11:41.665
I'll pick and hide them all

11:41.689 --> 11:42.689
for you.

11:43.045 --> 11:44.045
OK.

11:44.470 --> 11:45.720
When hawthorns are ripe,

11:46.070 --> 11:47.250
I'll go see you.

11:52.495 --> 11:53.495
Alright.

11:53.920 --> 11:54.796
- Let's go.
- Hey.

11:54.820 --> 11:55.820
Wait.

11:59.545 --> 12:00.545
Huangman'er.

12:02.595 --> 12:04.250
I want something of yours.

12:06.245 --> 12:08.645
When I miss you,

12:08.795 --> 12:09.890
I can look at it.

12:11.570 --> 12:12.570
Yes.

12:22.995 --> 12:24.170
OK. Brother.

12:25.020 --> 12:26.530
If you miss me,

12:26.820 --> 12:27.890
call my name loudly.

12:28.395 --> 12:29.729
I can definitely hear.

12:33.820 --> 12:34.820
Alright.

12:35.569 --> 12:36.145
Your Highness.

12:36.320 --> 12:37.320
Come.

12:37.670 --> 12:38.670
Let's go, my disciple.

12:40.845 --> 12:41.845
Wait.

12:42.595 --> 12:43.595
Your Highness.

12:44.170 --> 12:45.209
Can you

12:45.329 --> 12:48.520
take a message to Wang Chonglou?

12:49.645 --> 12:50.645
Please go ahead.

12:51.370 --> 12:54.689
"Chief Wang's known for Dahuangting.

12:54.729 --> 12:57.209
How can you hide it?

12:57.745 --> 13:00.020
Mount Longhu would like a spar

13:00.170 --> 13:02.449
and see the brilliance of Dahuangting".

13:02.570 --> 13:03.645
These are the words.

13:03.870 --> 13:06.070
Please relay the message to him.

13:07.595 --> 13:09.890
Will you suppress Wudang by force?

13:11.220 --> 13:12.370
We are sects.

13:12.645 --> 13:13.645
It's all like this.

13:13.745 --> 13:14.745
Alright.

13:15.095 --> 13:16.209
Let's go, my disciple.

13:26.770 --> 13:27.770
Huangman'er.

13:28.670 --> 13:30.020
If you don't want to go,

13:30.395 --> 13:31.569
tell me.

13:32.245 --> 13:33.370
I'll keep you.

13:43.520 --> 13:45.809
Do you know how to get him back?

13:54.495 --> 13:55.495
I know.

13:57.720 --> 13:58.929
If I take over North Liang,

13:59.970 --> 14:01.295
then I can get him back.

14:07.645 --> 14:09.650
You said you didn't want to.

14:12.345 --> 14:14.020
If everything is on me,

14:16.495 --> 14:18.209
it'll be easier for Huangman'er.

14:27.695 --> 14:28.695
Eh?

14:35.545 --> 14:37.345
Did something big happen?

14:43.270 --> 14:44.410
Why did he look at you?

15:09.670 --> 15:10.729
What happened?

15:11.470 --> 15:13.490
I just got the message.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.329
Is it about me?

15:19.070 --> 15:20.745
Say it.

15:24.170 --> 15:25.451
Jian Jiuhuang

15:26.645 --> 15:27.729
is dead.

15:38.320 --> 15:39.320
Give it to me.

15:46.020 --> 15:49.245
Jian Jiuhuang went to Wudi City.

15:49.890 --> 15:51.570
He found a tavern,

15:52.970 --> 15:54.929
ordered two taels of rice wine...

15:55.570 --> 15:57.646
(Jian Jiuhuang walked in Wudi City, )
half tael of sauced meat

15:57.670 --> 15:59.510
(with the sword box...)
and a plate of peanuts.

16:00.720 --> 16:01.720
Fried ones.

16:03.795 --> 16:05.370
He didn't like vinegar-soaked ones.

16:06.195 --> 16:07.345
Nor boiled ones.

16:09.195 --> 16:12.270
He preferred fried peanuts with salt.

16:45.245 --> 16:47.396
(Jian Jiuhuang watched Wudi City
from above, )

16:47.420 --> 16:49.248
(Wang Xianzhi arrived...)

17:19.220 --> 17:21.249
Wang Xianzhi arrived.

17:21.395 --> 17:23.195
Jian Jiuhuang used five swords,

17:23.295 --> 17:25.320
fighting with eight sword moves.

17:25.720 --> 17:28.185
Wang Xianzhi fought
with a single hand,

17:28.209 --> 17:29.529
not taking a step back.

17:29.895 --> 17:31.095
After 68 moves,

17:31.570 --> 17:33.410
Jian Jiuhuang played the Ninth Move.

17:34.289 --> 17:37.449
A martial artist who witnessed this move

17:38.045 --> 17:39.045
said it was like

17:39.170 --> 17:40.529
the Milky Way

17:40.670 --> 17:42.090
flowing down.

17:42.370 --> 17:44.170
It was no earthly swordplay.

17:44.945 --> 17:47.729
Wang Xianzhi finally used both hands.

17:47.920 --> 17:50.920
Jian Jiuhuang damaged Wang's sleeve.

17:51.170 --> 17:52.820
The two were well matched.

17:52.969 --> 17:54.595
After another 49 moves,

17:55.345 --> 17:58.320
Jian Jiuhuang died of exhaustion.

18:00.020 --> 18:01.220
Old Huang didn't lose.

18:02.845 --> 18:04.170
He was just old.

18:05.745 --> 18:06.420
Um.

18:06.620 --> 18:09.050
Wang Xianzhi admitted it himself.

18:10.345 --> 18:12.495
Jian Jiuhuang was just too exhausted.

18:12.795 --> 18:13.795
In the battle,

18:13.890 --> 18:14.890
he was

18:15.045 --> 18:16.470
slightly at a disadvantage.

18:18.130 --> 18:19.665
Before Jian Jiuhuang died,

18:19.689 --> 18:20.771
Wang Xianzhi asked him

18:20.795 --> 18:22.650
the name of the swordplay.

18:23.895 --> 18:24.929
"The Six Thousand Li".

18:27.545 --> 18:28.570
I gave the name

18:30.620 --> 18:32.130
for this move.

18:32.890 --> 18:34.095
The Ninth Move.

18:34.895 --> 18:36.445
"The Six Thousand Li".

18:38.520 --> 18:40.270
Wang Xianzhi sighed,

18:40.770 --> 18:42.220
"In the world,

18:43.995 --> 18:47.446
(Jian Jiuhuang seemed to say)
there is no better swordplay than this."

18:47.470 --> 18:48.790
(his last words to Wang Xianzhi.)

18:48.895 --> 18:50.529
Where is his sword box?

18:51.420 --> 18:53.610
At the wall of Wudi City.

18:56.095 --> 18:57.047
At last,

18:57.071 --> 18:59.489
his meridians were all broken,

18:59.820 --> 19:00.995
sitting still at the wall

19:02.020 --> 19:04.645
and looking north
with the last breath.

19:05.595 --> 19:08.795
People heard him

19:09.045 --> 19:10.729
humming an odd song

19:11.170 --> 19:12.920
until his death.

19:17.820 --> 19:18.820
The north.

19:19.470 --> 19:21.030
(His meridians were all broken, )
He was

19:21.545 --> 19:23.106
(sitting at the wall and looking north)
watching North Liang.

19:23.130 --> 19:24.130
(until his death.)

19:24.845 --> 19:26.796
Few could corner Wang Xianzhi

19:26.820 --> 19:28.570
like that.

19:29.020 --> 19:30.090
Jian Jiuhuang

19:30.495 --> 19:32.136
is already a legend.

19:38.045 --> 19:39.045
Can I

19:41.470 --> 19:42.670
keep this letter?

19:46.820 --> 19:47.820
Sure.

19:48.070 --> 19:49.070
Thanks.

19:54.870 --> 19:56.395
Sorry for your loss, Your Highness.

19:57.670 --> 19:58.850
Jian Jiuhuang

20:00.045 --> 20:02.130
achieved what he sought.

20:04.720 --> 20:06.145
Farewell.

20:45.895 --> 20:46.895
They've gone.

21:30.595 --> 21:32.170
Did Jian Jiuhuang die in a battle?

21:34.420 --> 21:36.595
Were the details noted down?

21:44.370 --> 21:46.410
He forced Wang Xianzhi
to use both hands.

21:48.420 --> 21:50.345
The Ninth Move, Six Thousand Li
was awesome!

21:50.595 --> 21:52.220
Badly, I can't see it myself.

22:16.720 --> 22:19.071
(The Ninth Move's name is
given by Jian Jiuhuang himself.)

22:19.095 --> 22:21.695
(Jian Jiuhuang seemed to say
his last words to Wang Xianzhi.)

22:49.750 --> 22:51.750
(Jian Jiuhuang watched Wudi City
from above...)

23:20.645 --> 23:21.645
Young Master.

23:22.045 --> 23:23.146
Learning martial arts

23:23.170 --> 23:24.220
is not a loss.

23:24.270 --> 23:25.026
You have the strength...

23:25.050 --> 23:26.050
You're nagging.

23:33.145 --> 23:35.170
We traveled for 3 years.

23:35.820 --> 23:38.449
I've put every bit of it into it.

23:39.220 --> 23:40.220
Then

23:41.195 --> 23:42.449
the Ninth Move was created.

23:44.270 --> 23:45.646
Name it as Six Thousand Li.

23:45.670 --> 23:48.186
(The Ninth Move's name is
Six Thousand Li.)

23:48.795 --> 23:50.689
I can do you some help.

23:51.595 --> 23:53.671
(His meridians were all broken...)
Now I fear nothing.

23:53.695 --> 23:54.796
(until his death.)
I promise you.

23:54.820 --> 23:55.921
I'll be right back after the battle

23:55.945 --> 23:57.845
and roast sweet potatoes for you first.

23:57.945 --> 23:58.945
OK.

24:46.370 --> 24:47.570
Candles are not enough.

24:49.145 --> 24:50.195
Make it lighter.

24:51.770 --> 24:52.970
I can't see clearly.

25:08.745 --> 25:09.845
Have you seen enough?

25:29.195 --> 25:30.395
Old Huang is dead.

25:30.970 --> 25:31.970
Understand?

25:34.295 --> 25:35.295
Something is wrong.

25:36.090 --> 25:37.090
What is wrong?

25:38.720 --> 25:40.395
What the letter said.

25:46.195 --> 25:47.320
Where?

25:51.245 --> 25:53.770
I've read it over and over.

25:56.720 --> 25:59.820
Only the name Jian Jiuhuang is on it.

26:02.920 --> 26:04.270
Why is there no "Old Huang"?

26:08.145 --> 26:09.546
They only know Jian Jiuhuang

26:09.570 --> 26:10.845
was a peerless swordsman.

26:12.529 --> 26:13.695
Who would think he was

26:14.245 --> 26:15.395
the groom Old Huang?

26:21.570 --> 26:22.920
Zhao Xituan said,

26:26.420 --> 26:28.495
Jian Jiuhuang cornered Wang Xianzhi

26:31.445 --> 26:32.795
and he has become a legend.

26:35.220 --> 26:36.410
A legend indeed.

26:41.295 --> 26:44.320
Jian Jiuhuang has become a legend,

26:47.345 --> 26:49.395
but Old Huang is dead.

26:54.270 --> 26:56.745
I'd rather him not be a legend.

26:59.620 --> 27:01.225
I'd rather he came back to North Liang

27:01.249 --> 27:03.209
as a loser.

27:08.320 --> 27:09.320
Then

27:11.295 --> 27:12.870
I'd laugh,

27:14.345 --> 27:15.345
and let him

27:15.695 --> 27:17.470
steal sweet potatoes and roast.

27:21.745 --> 27:23.095
Old Huang is gone.

27:30.895 --> 27:31.895
Yeah.

27:36.445 --> 27:37.445
Old Huang is gone.

28:02.620 --> 28:03.620
Let's go home.

28:05.170 --> 28:06.845
Your brother went to Mount Longhu.

28:07.745 --> 28:09.650
You have no reason to stay in Wudang.

28:15.470 --> 28:16.470
Old Huang.

28:19.720 --> 28:20.969
I want to learn martial arts.

28:45.620 --> 28:47.090
You wanna learn martial arts?

28:47.520 --> 28:49.545
Given your identity,

28:49.745 --> 28:51.195
whoever you want to kill,

28:51.370 --> 28:53.410
North Liang Cavalry can do it.

28:53.595 --> 28:54.689
I wanna do it myself,

28:54.995 --> 28:56.970
to challenge Wang Xianzhi in Wudi City.

28:57.720 --> 28:59.729
Do you know what you are saying?

29:00.045 --> 29:01.529
Old Huang died in Wudi City.

29:01.970 --> 29:03.196
I'll take his sword box back.

29:03.220 --> 29:04.370
Take it back?

29:05.120 --> 29:06.650
You know who Wang Xianzhi is!

29:06.795 --> 29:09.195
He is unrivaled in the world.

29:09.595 --> 29:11.505
You didn't learn any martial arts.

29:11.529 --> 29:12.670
Do you want to

29:13.120 --> 29:14.620
challenge Wang Xianzhi?

29:14.670 --> 29:15.670
Yes.

29:15.995 --> 29:16.769
You can

29:16.820 --> 29:17.895
go get a bed.

29:18.120 --> 29:19.769
Lie on it, close your eyes,

29:20.295 --> 29:21.272
and dream it.

29:21.296 --> 29:22.570
I'm not as good as him now,

29:22.720 --> 29:23.720
but I can practice.

29:25.545 --> 29:27.929
You think you are a genius?

29:28.045 --> 29:30.245
How long will it take to be his match?

29:31.645 --> 29:32.547
Fifty years?

29:32.571 --> 29:33.650
No matter how many years,

29:34.195 --> 29:35.650
the sword box can't be at the wall.

29:38.670 --> 29:39.745
Please tutor me.

29:45.345 --> 29:46.345
Are you

29:46.545 --> 29:47.570
serious?

29:51.020 --> 29:52.020
Alright.

29:52.489 --> 29:53.720
What do you wanna practice?

29:54.320 --> 29:55.186
I only have a blade.

29:55.210 --> 29:56.220
Practice blade then.

29:57.520 --> 29:58.745
Unsheathe the blade.

30:02.295 --> 30:03.410
Straighten your arm.

30:05.120 --> 30:06.545
Stand for an hour.

30:17.810 --> 30:19.070
If the stone falls

30:20.270 --> 30:22.045
in an hour,

30:22.895 --> 30:24.095
don't come to me again.

30:56.120 --> 30:57.096
Are you alright?

30:57.120 --> 30:58.120
Stay away from me.

31:08.720 --> 31:09.995
Time is up.

31:11.170 --> 31:12.289
The stone didn't fall.

31:16.720 --> 31:17.720
My admiration.

31:18.945 --> 31:20.489
Next, four moves.

31:22.745 --> 31:23.745
Thrust.

31:25.395 --> 31:26.395
Slice.

31:26.945 --> 31:27.945
Split.

31:29.620 --> 31:30.620
Sweep.

31:45.270 --> 31:46.395
4,000 times each.

32:13.070 --> 32:14.289
You should know

32:14.770 --> 32:18.626
Wang Xianzhi is
a barrier to all martial artists.

32:18.650 --> 32:21.795
No one can surpass him.

32:22.195 --> 32:23.546
Even

32:23.570 --> 32:26.745
the God of Sword Li Chungang's

32:26.895 --> 32:30.610
sword Mumaniu was broken by him
with two fingers.

32:31.920 --> 32:33.645
Zhao Xituan has a message
to Wang Chonglou.

32:34.545 --> 32:35.545
What is it?

32:36.420 --> 32:39.745
"Chief Wang is known for Dahuangting.

32:39.769 --> 32:42.120
Mount Longhu would like a spar

32:42.495 --> 32:44.820
and see the brilliance of Dahuangting".

32:46.795 --> 32:48.471
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

32:48.495 --> 32:49.495
I forgot.

32:56.695 --> 32:57.945
A spar?

32:58.845 --> 33:00.445
That's a challenge.

33:02.370 --> 33:05.170
Mount Longhu will take action on us.

33:06.095 --> 33:07.870
We've never offended Mount Longhu.

33:09.645 --> 33:11.470
Mount Longhu is in its prime.

33:11.795 --> 33:13.620
The court backs them up.

33:14.120 --> 33:16.386
I've achieved Dahuangting.

33:16.410 --> 33:18.330
They want to defeat me,

33:18.895 --> 33:21.745
going up by taking Wudang
as a stepping stone.

33:22.870 --> 33:24.670
We can simply defeat them.

33:27.420 --> 33:28.845
It's not that easy.

33:29.945 --> 33:31.620
If we win,

33:32.120 --> 33:35.130
Wudang will be Mount Longhu's
first enemy.

33:36.470 --> 33:38.021
By then,

33:38.045 --> 33:40.096
(Sanqing Hall)

33:40.120 --> 33:41.146
Wudang

33:41.170 --> 33:44.130
could be doomed in my hand.

33:45.195 --> 33:46.769
We can't win or lose.

33:47.645 --> 33:48.729
This is really hard.

33:52.395 --> 33:53.890
What is Xu Fengnian doing?

33:55.570 --> 33:56.620
Practicing blade.

34:05.145 --> 34:06.330
How is my bladeplay?

34:06.945 --> 34:08.320
It's awful.

34:09.795 --> 34:12.045
1,000 times more for each move.

34:12.289 --> 34:13.920
Looks like I do have some talent.

34:14.520 --> 34:15.809
Who said that?

34:16.345 --> 34:17.610
You promised Old Huang

34:18.420 --> 34:19.995
you'd protect me for only two months.

34:20.195 --> 34:22.130
Then you would leave.

34:22.595 --> 34:24.010
Now two months is over.

34:25.650 --> 34:27.825
If I'm not good,

34:27.849 --> 34:29.610
will you still tutor me here?

34:29.945 --> 34:31.289
The Xus

34:32.170 --> 34:34.050
are all sly like you.

34:35.620 --> 34:36.745
How talented

34:37.445 --> 34:38.745
do you think I am?

34:39.895 --> 34:40.895
I can't deny it.

34:41.470 --> 34:43.570
You are made for bladeplay.

34:44.645 --> 34:45.825
The blade skills can be practiced.

34:45.849 --> 34:47.620
What about your genuine spirit?

34:47.945 --> 34:48.689
Practice it as well.

34:48.870 --> 34:50.145
It can be practiced,

34:50.289 --> 34:51.650
but it's too late.

34:52.020 --> 34:54.185
Practicing genuine spirit is hard work.

34:54.209 --> 34:55.645
It's trained over time.

34:56.270 --> 34:58.095
Given your age,

34:58.220 --> 34:59.660
you can hardly catch up with others.

34:59.945 --> 35:01.545
Is there a shortcut?

35:01.895 --> 35:02.895
No.

35:03.090 --> 35:05.145
The truth is cruel.

35:05.849 --> 35:06.849
You can never

35:06.895 --> 35:08.795
be Wang's match all your life.

35:09.820 --> 35:11.021
To go to Wudi City,

35:11.045 --> 35:12.205
using the North Liang Cavalry

35:12.945 --> 35:14.570
is the only way.

35:15.920 --> 35:17.245
Tomorrow, 2,000 times more

35:18.195 --> 35:19.570
of each move.

35:21.070 --> 35:22.769
It's in vain.

35:24.020 --> 35:25.670
Without inner power,

35:26.145 --> 35:29.020
you can be a second-tier master at best.

35:30.570 --> 35:31.595
I'll try hard.

35:39.920 --> 35:42.561
Inner power? Genuine spirit?

36:49.370 --> 36:51.870
Do you wanna cut off the waterfall?

36:52.870 --> 36:55.120
I'm trying to practice genuine spirit.

36:56.745 --> 36:58.370
You can't cut it off like that.

36:59.970 --> 37:00.970
Can you?

37:03.895 --> 37:05.090
I can't either.

37:06.370 --> 37:08.729
But I might not hurt my hand.

37:09.895 --> 37:10.895
Have a try.

37:42.809 --> 37:43.809
Do you play martial arts?

37:46.170 --> 37:47.170
No.

37:47.870 --> 37:49.050
What was it then?

37:50.645 --> 37:52.130
It's the fist arts.

37:52.645 --> 37:54.046
You don't play martial arts.

37:54.070 --> 37:55.130
Where did you learn it?

37:55.945 --> 37:57.095
I created it by myself.

37:57.220 --> 37:58.720
By yourself?

38:00.395 --> 38:02.246
I read Taoist scriptures
in Xuanyue Palace.

38:02.270 --> 38:03.769
I stretched my arms after a long sit.

38:04.095 --> 38:05.270
I came up with it.

38:05.520 --> 38:08.209
It's from Eight Trigrams to
Four Divisions,

38:08.245 --> 38:10.695
Three Elements to Yin and Yang,

38:11.070 --> 38:13.120
though it's much inferior

38:13.270 --> 38:14.270
to Taiji and Wuji.

38:17.670 --> 38:19.050
It's not something serious,

38:19.420 --> 38:20.570
not for fighting.

38:21.545 --> 38:24.720
But cutting waterfall
won't hurt your hand.

38:25.695 --> 38:27.445
You can try it if you want.

38:27.920 --> 38:29.246
Can the fist arts

38:29.270 --> 38:30.369
be used for bladeplay?

38:33.695 --> 38:35.496
One rule may suit all.

38:35.520 --> 38:36.971
Fist arts have no difference
from blade arts.

38:36.995 --> 38:38.570
So, you can learn bladeplay

38:38.995 --> 38:40.495
from sword manuals.

38:40.920 --> 38:41.695
What sword manuals?

38:41.920 --> 38:43.846
(Jiazi Sword Manual at Lyushui)
The basic sword manual of Wudang.

38:43.870 --> 38:46.220
See if you can be inspired.

38:47.490 --> 38:49.170
Is there a shortcut for genuine spirit?

38:50.729 --> 38:51.729
No.

39:22.670 --> 39:23.720
It's ugly.

39:24.695 --> 39:25.845
Wash before sleeping.

39:34.395 --> 39:36.270
Do you think what you do

39:36.945 --> 39:38.689
will get Old Huang back to life?

39:43.045 --> 39:44.320
During the three-year travel,

39:45.720 --> 39:47.440
Old Huang had told me
to learn martial arts.

39:49.195 --> 39:50.570
I turned a deaf ear to it.

39:53.220 --> 39:53.947
I thought

39:53.971 --> 39:55.895
I could deal with problems

39:56.170 --> 39:57.370
with my wisdom.

40:01.695 --> 40:03.470
Now I get to know,

40:04.545 --> 40:06.320
the so-called wisdom

40:07.420 --> 40:08.729
is useless.

40:10.645 --> 40:12.130
When I was desperate,

40:13.895 --> 40:15.070
it was Old Huang

40:16.320 --> 40:18.220
who got me out of it.

40:24.470 --> 40:25.670
I'm learning martial arts now.

40:27.795 --> 40:30.095
First, I wanna take his sword box back.

40:31.720 --> 40:32.720
Second,

40:34.595 --> 40:35.507
I don't want anyone

40:35.531 --> 40:36.849
to die for me again

40:38.020 --> 40:39.670
in such a situation,

40:40.420 --> 40:42.090
whereas I cannot do anything.

40:46.595 --> 40:48.270
If Old Huang saw that

40:48.845 --> 40:50.249
I could protect myself,

40:52.795 --> 40:54.329
he might smile.

40:59.645 --> 41:01.249
Don't train yourself to death.

41:35.720 --> 41:36.720
Jiang Ni.

41:37.370 --> 41:38.545
Can you promise me something?

41:39.695 --> 41:40.695
What?

41:41.620 --> 41:43.145
If I get into trouble in the future,

41:43.695 --> 41:45.395
leave me alone and run away.

41:45.845 --> 41:46.845
OK?

41:52.849 --> 41:53.849
Noisy.

41:54.820 --> 41:55.820
Sleep.

42:18.270 --> 42:19.795
If you were dying,

42:20.395 --> 42:22.769
I'd stab you with Divine Token,

42:23.995 --> 42:25.695
at least to kill you with my own hands.

42:31.495 --> 42:33.020
You should stab well.

42:34.045 --> 42:35.485
You'll lose money if you fail again.

44:56.970 --> 45:00.945
♪ The flower of pain ♪
